From: Lapin UX <arnz.lee16@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:34:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: Windows-style file dialog footer

File name / Save as type rows with the type filter beside the name,
Open/Save then Cancel at the bottom right; folders first; no preview pane
by default.

Only in a Lapin UX session (XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP has LapinUX, or
LAPIN_UX_DIALOG=1); in COSMIC's own session the dialog is COSMIC's.
